node_modules/
dist/
.superpowers/
.worktrees/
.codegraph/
.types/
*.tsbuildinfo
*.tgz
packages/*/temp/
# Playwright test artifacts (test/browser-media gate)
test-results/
playwright-report/
blob-report/
# FreeSWITCH matrix runtime artifacts (fs.log + WAVs per run)
test/freeswitch-matrix/artifacts/
# Asterisk matrix runtime artifacts (container log + AMI transcripts per run).
# Anchored to the repo root: astctl.ts writes them under process.cwd(), which is
# the repo root for the npm script — unlike the FreeSWITCH harness, whose runDir
# is inside its own test tree.
/artifacts/
# The Asterisk matrix RUN RECORD (MATRIX_RECORD_FILE). Deliberately NOT under
# /artifacts/: the record is written on every run, green included, so putting it
# there would make artifacts/ never empty and disarm the CI guard that detects a
# failed artifact collection. Anchored the same way, for the same reason.
/matrix-record/
